WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:03,270
Go to the suburbs and find a place where there are not many zombies.

2
00:00:03,270 --> 00:00:06,530
But we must first solve the problem that the oil trucks are running out.

3
00:00:06,530 --> 00:00:11,070
Isn’t it possible to run without a range-enhancing vehicle?

4
00:00:11,070 --> 00:00:14,140
The battery life is short and you have to rely on oil to generate electricity.

5
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:15,140
Can't last far

6
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:17,620
Where are the gas stations in the suburbs?

7
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:21,620
Even if there is a doomsday gas station, can I still fill up with gas?

8
00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:22,620
Basically can't

9
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:25,030
But I have a way, don't worry

10
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:32,800
Now you know another reason why you don’t go into the city.

11
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:36,370
You really can’t enter the city

12
00:00:36,370 --> 00:00:45,820
you are getting stronger

13
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:47,590
Rest here first

14
00:00:47,590 --> 00:00:50,590
I have to make up for the fuel-saving measures before it gets dark.
